Bundled code
------------

Moonfin Plugin (Moonbase) - GPL-3.0
  https://github.com/Moonfin-Client/Plugin (LICENSE: GNU GPL v3; README
  states GPL-3.0)
  Files, taken from Jellyfin/backend/EmulatorJS/ at commit
  9b9ee1e35a7b6d23f496c9866246b0ccb2e234dd:
    crates/remux-server/assets/moonfin/player.html
      MODIFIED by Remux: data-path and CSP-nonce placeholders are
      substituted at serve time, inline scripts carry the CSP nonce, and
      the EmulatorJS update check is disabled.
    crates/remux-server/assets/moonfin/moonfin-bridge.js
      Content unmodified; only an origin comment line was added at the top.
  Both files keep their GPL-3.0 license. GPL-3.0 section 13 permits
  combining GPL-3.0 and AGPL-3.0 works.

  Data: crates/remux-server/assets/moonfin/default-options.json is the list
  of default settings options (keys, labels, groups, choices and help
  text) for the admin page forms. It is DERIVED from Moonbase
  Jellyfin/backend/Pages/configPage.html and
  Jellyfin/backend/Models/MoonfinSettingsProfile.cs at commit
  7ccfd6bc9d043c34eb2b00efcf8fb68679e354ee, reshaped into JSON, with options
  for features Remux lacks moved to its "excluded" list. It stays under
  GPL-3.0 and is separate from the AGPL-3.0 server code that reads it.

  The Moonfin API served by Remux (/Moonfin/...) is an independent
  reimplementation written for client compatibility; it is not a copy of
  the Moonbase server code.

Downloaded at runtime (not bundled)
-----------------------------------

EmulatorJS - GPL-3.0
  https://github.com/EmulatorJS/EmulatorJS (license verified: GPL-3.0,
  v4.2.3 LICENSE file). The server downloads and self-hosts a pinned
  release, version 4.2.3, on the operator's request; the files are not
  part of this repository. Emulator cores fetched with it carry their own
  licenses.

libretro database - CC-BY-SA-4.0
  https://github.com/libretro/libretro-database (license verified via the
  GitHub license API: CC-BY-SA-4.0). The per-system .rdb files are
  downloaded and cached at runtime for game metadata. Attribution is owed
  to the libretro database contributors; derived data is share-alike.

libretro thumbnails
  https://github.com/libretro-thumbnails/libretro-thumbnails, served from
  https://thumbnails.libretro.com. Game box art is fetched at runtime. NOT
  VERIFIED: no license file was found for this repository or its README,
  so terms of use are unconfirmed. Individual images belong to their
  respective rights holders.

Optional external services
--------------------------

LaunchBox Games Database
  https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/Metadata.zip. Opt-in
  (games_launchbox_enabled) and disabled by default; fetched at runtime and
  reduced to a local index. LaunchBox publishes no terms for this download
  (NOT VERIFIED beyond that), so whoever enables it is responsible for
  complying with LaunchBox's terms.

MDBList API
  https://api.mdblist.com. Used for ratings with an API key supplied by the
  admin (server-wide) or the user; subject to MDBList's terms of service,
  which were not reviewed here.
